---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Digital Products and Refunds | Prilla Treasures"
  description="Digital delivery, file support and refund information for Prissy Toddler Tools."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1>Digital Products and Refunds</h1>
    <p>What to expect before and after checkout</p>
  </header>

  <article class="content-shell article-body">
    <div class="notice-box">
      <p><strong>Launch draft.</strong> The final refund period and payment provider process must be approved and matched here before checkout is enabled.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Digital delivery</h2>
    <p>Digital products are delivered through the payment provider after payment is verified. No physical item is posted. The receipt and download instructions go to the email used at checkout.</p>

    <h2>Download problems</h2>
    <p>If a paid file is missing, damaged or will not open, contact <a href="mailto:founder@prillatreasures.com">founder@prillatreasures.com</a> with the product name, order email and a description of the problem. Do not send payment card details.</p>

    <h2>Duplicate purchases</h2>
    <p>If the same product is purchased twice by mistake, contact the founder promptly so the order record can be checked with the payment provider.</p>

    <h2>Refund requests</h2>
    <p>Digital files cannot be returned in the way a physical item can. Refund requests are reviewed according to the final published policy, the payment provider rules and any rights required by law. The approved final rule will appear here before sales begin.</p>

    <h2>File access</h2>
    <p>Keep the receipt and download email. Raw permanent file links are not published on this website. Expired or invalid access should be reported through the contact email.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
